description: Never add Cursor co-author attribution to git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor git attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / `cursoragent@cursor.com` / `Made-with: Cursor` to commits or PRs.
- Never use `git commit --trailer` for Cursor attribution.
- If a commit message would include those lines, strip them before committing.
- Prefer `git commit-tree` or a stripped message file when the environment injects trailers.
